# What host/actionpanel/init.lua needs, declared beside the file that consumes it. Format is
# name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
#
# core is not a tool to install, it is a capability the composition root hands this file
# from Olm's own lib, so this line decides injection rather than installation. Optional,
# because only a row's own icon degrades without it, deps.icon defaults to answering nothing
# for every glyph, while the row itself still lists, still filters, and still runs its verb.
glyphicon | core | lib/glyphicon.lua | optional | drawing an icon for a verb row from the glyph its binding carries in config/keys.lua
